  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assets to Adolescent Girl&apos;s Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aims to support around 80 businesses and reach up to 200,000 girls with physical and tangible products that contribute to their economic empowerment. The programme will support early-stage, innovative business ventures with grant funding and intensive technical assistance, to ensure that their products reach girls directly and at scale. It will support ventures with operations in East Africa and South Asia.</narrative>
  </description>
